speechtext:
For a copy of the lease originally made by the Canadian Broadcasting Corporation or by the Canadian radio commission for the leasing of radio station CKGW at Toronto;
Also, a copy of all correspondence, letters, telegrams and other documents passing between the proprietors of the said station CKGW and the Canadian radio commission and/or the Canadian Broadcasting Corporation;
And also, a copy of all correspondence, letters, telegrams and other documents passing between the proprietors of the said station CKGW and the Canadian Broadcasting Corporation relative to the termination of the lease above mentioned.

It is as follows:
(d) "Lending institution" means a loan, insurance, trust or other company or corporation authorized to lend money on the security of real or immovable property;
Paragraph (d) as amended agreed to.
